    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Event freshness measurement",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Broker acknowledgment \u2192 unique aggregate contribution is measured by bounded eventgen probes. See `docs/benchmarking.md` and the committed measurement report/graphs. Snapshot refresh age is a separate signal. Successful freshness percentiles exclude failed/censored probes; always review those counts and host sleep qualification."
      }
    }
  ]
}
